Hitting your wife is not the right solution to what ever problem you may be facing. Instead, consider taking the following steps:
- Talk to your wife and express your feelings in a calm and respectful manner;
- Seek couples counseling to work on communication and any underlying issues that may be leading to conflict;
- Take a break from each other, if necessary, to give both of you some space and time to reflect and come back with a clear head;
- Find an external support system, such as family or friends who can provide you with emotional support and a sounding board to help you see things more clearly;
- Take some time for yourself to unwind and relax, even if it's just a quick break, to give you time to regroup and come back ready to face the challenge.
